{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/4c009f5f14bb87075013fc335805f646.poster.avif?t=1768160930\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/4c009f5f14bb87075013fc335805f646.webm?t=1768160930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/4c009f5f14bb87075013fc335805f646.mp4?t=1768160930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the D.A.C!</strong></h2><br>As a Recruit of the Data Administration Corps, your job is to hold down a Base while it collects data on various planets across the galaxy.<br>This task won't be easy, as these Alien planets are home to a pletora of man-eating gigantic Insects. You'll need to <strong>scavenge</strong>, <strong>build</strong>, <strong>level up</strong>, then maybe you'll stand a chance at surviving the <strong>swarm</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/c076902614ed359ad9bcd1276c7b3d2b.avif?t=1768160930\" width=616 height=180 /></span><br><br>Don't worry though, you will be receiving drop boxes every morning containing <strong>Scrap, Ammo, and Medkits</strong>. You will need to <strong>explore</strong> the map and dispatch any hostiles you find while collecting loot to build a strong base<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/fa09c7d504c212622d07abe72acb1028.avif?t=1768160930\" width=616 height=180 /></span><br><br>When you have enough scrap, you'll be able to <strong>Build</strong> an inpenetrable fortress that will hold against any monstrosity this planet throws at you. Barricades, Turrets, Flamethrower Turrets, Missile Turrets, and even <strong>Mechs</strong> that you can Control or have as a personal bodyguard.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/484ba16b3efd43f82e8d28783b4e3566.avif?t=1768160930\" width=616 height=180 /></span><br><br>As you explore and kill bugs, you will become <strong>stronger</strong> with randomized abilities you can choose from with each level. From flaming bullets to Invulnerability, you'll become a <strong>killing machine</strong> in no time!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/a023d0813780d7666ccf201518edfbf7.avif?t=1768160930\" width=616 height=180 /></span><br><br>You can also create your perfect space soldier with many <strong>customization options</strong> for your character model, skin color, and building color.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/de4b22b98d3fb54fd15b4f7abdaa6940.avif?t=1768160930\" width=616 height=180 /></span><br><br>When you inevitably die you will get a hefty sum of gold which you can use to buy <strong>upgrades</strong> to all of your ingame Stats. These will take permanent effect as soon as you start a new match and will help you reach new heights and become even stronger.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/5a94a98a3292da16161c3caf71adc791.avif?t=1768160930\" width=616 height=180 /></span><br><br>Don't worry though, you won't have to face the bugs alone. You can bring <strong>up to 3 friends</strong> to explore, build, and survive together! If you don't have any friends, you are automatically provided with a <strong>Canine Unit</strong> as your personal bodyguard.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2526880?t=1768160930","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768160930","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/c117b1a1db3c36b1420af4c78773136bf31a4325/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768160930","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/c117b1a1db3c36b1420af4c78773136bf31a4325/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768160930","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3017790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/4c009f5f14bb87075013fc335805f646.poster.avif?t=1768160930\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/4c009f5f14bb87075013fc335805f646.webm?t=1768160930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/4c009f5f14bb87075013fc335805f646.mp4?t=1768160930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the D.A.C!</strong></h2><br>As a Recruit of the Data Administration Corps, your job is to hold down a Base while it collects data on various planets across the galaxy.<br>This task won't be easy, as these Alien planets are home to a pletora of man-eating gigantic Insects. You'll need to <strong>scavenge</strong>, <strong>build</