<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/de4b22b98d3fb54fd15b4f7abdaa6940.avif?t=1768160930\" width=616 height=180 /></span><br><br>When you inevitably die you will get a hefty sum of gold which you can use to buy <strong>upgrades</strong> to all of your ingame Stats. These will take permanent effect as soon as you start a new match and will help you reach new heights and become even stronger.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/extras/5a94a98a3292da16161c3caf71adc791.avif?t=1768160930\" width=616 height=180 /></span><br><br>Don't worry though, you won't have to face the bugs alone. You can bring <strong>up to 3 friends</strong> to explore, build, and survive together! If you don't have any friends, you are automatically provided with a <strong>Canine Unit</strong> as your personal bodyguard.","developers":["Lucky Dart"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2526880/8c05bac42f4e7a2dfcc29dba5a20243950c52a92/header.jpg?t=1768160930","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2526880/759525/523fc822a0b4e9f1e2f180e3c059f58968fc40ce/1750927791/dash_av1.mpd?t=1727026272","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2526880/759525/523fc822a0b4e9f1e2f180e3c059f58968fc40ce/1750927791/dash_h264.mpd?t=1727026272","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2526880/759525/523fc822a0b4e9f1e2f180e3c059f58968fc40ce/1750927791/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1727026272","id":257057350,"name":"Defender Bros Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai